<body>
  <div class="topline"></div>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="Damith Nadishan home"><span class="brand-mark">DN<span>.</span></span><span class="brand-name">DAMITH NADISHAN<small>ENGINEERING PORTFOLIO</small></span></a>
    <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span></button>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="#about">About</a><a href="#expertise">Expertise</a><a href="#projects">Projects</a><a href="#experience">Experience</a><a href="#patents">Patents</a><a class="nav-contact" href="#contact">Contact <span>↗</span></a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero section-wrap" id="home">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow"><i></i> ENGINEERING · INNOVATION · PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT</div>
        <h1>Turning complex engineering challenges into <em>working technology.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">I'm Damith Nadishan — a Senior R&amp;D Engineer focused on embedded systems, motor control, power electronics, robotics and industrial automation.</p>
        <p class="hero-sub">25 years of engineering and IT experience, spanning product R&amp;D in Germany, industrial automation projects in the Maldives, and technology development in Sri Lanka.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#projects">Explore engineering work <span>↗</span></a><a class="button button-ghost" href="#contact">Contact me</a></div>
        <div class="hero-meta"><span><b></b> Based in Sri Lanka</span><span>Available for international opportunities</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="portrait-frame"><img src="assets/profile-damith.webp" alt="Portrait of Damith Nadishan"></div>
        <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
        <div class="hero-chip chip-a">EMBEDDED SYSTEMS</div><div class="hero-chip chip-b">MOTOR CONTROL</div><div class="hero-chip chip-c">INDUSTRIAL IoT</div>
        <div class="hero-note"><span class="note-dot"></span><span>IDEA → PROTOTYPE → PRODUCT</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="metrics section-wrap" aria-label="Career highlights">
      <div class="metric"><strong>25<span>+</span></strong><span>Years in engineering &amp; IT</span></div>
      <div class="metric"><strong>4</strong><span>US records in core portfolio · 2 granted, 2 applications</span></div>
      <div class="metric"><strong>11</strong><span>Years of product R&amp;D for Germany</span></div>
      <div class="metric"><strong>4</strong><span>Countries across project experience</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-wrap section-block" id="about">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / ABOUT</div><h2>Engineering across <em>disciplines.</em></h2></div><p>From software and IT systems to hardware R&amp;D, embedded control and industrial deployments.</p></div>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-copy"><p class="large-copy">I work across the boundary between electronics and software — designing, prototyping, testing and delivering systems that solve real operational problems.</p><p>My experience includes energy-conscious motor drives and battery management, humanoid robot prototyping, connected devices, industrial control panels, pump monitoring, process automation and custom electronics products.</p><p>I enjoy taking a project from an initial concept through circuit design, firmware, integration, testing and commissioning.</p></div>
        <div class="about-facts">
          <div><span class="fact-label">CURRENT ROLE</span><strong>Co-Founder &amp; CTO</strong><small>Perpion (Pvt) Ltd · 2023–Present</small></div>
          <div><span class="fact-label">CORE DISCIPLINE</span><strong>Embedded Systems &amp; Motor Control</strong><small>Hardware, firmware and product R&amp;D</small></div>
          <div><span class="fact-label">PROJECT REGIONS</span><strong>Sri Lanka · Germany · Maldives · Canada</strong><small>International product and project work</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-wrap section-block" id="expertise">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / TECHNICAL EXPERTISE</div><h2>What I <em>build with.</em></h2></div><p>A cross-functional engineering toolkit for connected products, control systems and industrial applications.</p></div>
      <div class="expertise-grid">
        <article class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">01</div><h3>Embedded firmware</h3><p>Microcontroller firmware, real-time control, communications and device integration.</p><div class="tags"><span>C / C++</span><span>STM32</span><span>8051</span><span>ESP32</span><span>RTOS</span></div></article>
        <article class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">02</div><h3>Motor control</h3><p>BLDC and PMSM drive development, FOC, motor sensing and performance characterisation.</p><div class="tags"><span>FOC</span><span>BLDC / PMSM</span><span>Inverters</span><span>VFD</span></div></article>
        <article class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">03</div><h3>Power electronics</h3><p>Power conversion, gate-drive systems, protection, battery management and energy-aware designs.</p><div class="tags"><span>IGBT / MOSFET</span><span>BMS</span><span>SPWM</span><span>Protection</span></div></article>
        <article class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">04</div><h3>Industrial automation</h3><p>PLC logic, electrical panels, pump control, HMI, process monitoring and commissioning.</p><div class="tags"><span>PLC</span><span>HMI</span><span>ATS</span><span>AutoCAD</span></div></article>
        <article class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">05</div><h3>IoT &amp; connected systems</h3><p>Connected devices, sensor acquisition, remote monitoring and industrial communication.</p><div class="tags"><span>RS485</span><span>Wi-Fi</span><span>GSM</span><span>Industrial IoT</span></div></article>
        <article class="skill-card"><div class="skill-icon">06</div><h3>Electronics &amp; product design</h3><p>Electronic circuit design, PCB development, prototyping, testing and productisation.</p><div class="tags"><span>PCB Design</span><span>Analog</span><span>Prototyping</span><span>Test</span></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="projects-section section-block" id="projects">
      <div class="section-wrap">
        <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">03 / SELECTED ENGINEERING WORK</div><h2>Projects built in the <em>real world.</em></h2></div><p>Selected work drawn from product development, client engineering and field deployments.</p></div>
        <div class="project-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects">
          <button class="filter active" data-filter="all">All work</button><button class="filter" data-filter="motor">Motor &amp; power</button><button class="filter" data-filter="robotics">Robotics</button><button class="filter" data-filter="automation">Automation</button><button class="filter" data-filter="iot">IoT &amp; products</button>
        </div>
        <div class="project-grid">
          <article class="project-card project-featured" data-category="motor">
            <a class="project-image" href="assets/bldc-motor-test-bench.webp" data-lightbox="Motor test bench"><img src="assets/bldc-motor-test-bench.webp" alt="BLDC motor test bench with sensors" loading="lazy"><span class="image-index">01 / MOTOR R&amp;D</span></a>
            <div class="project-body"><div class="project-kicker">PERPION / MOTOR R&amp;D</div><h3>Intelligent BLDC / PMSM motor control</h3><p>Development of motor-drive hardware and firmware, including motor characterisation, sensing, drive-pattern control and efficiency-focused development.</p><div class="project-specs"><span>24 V DC bus</span><span>16 kHz PWM</span><span>FOC control</span><span>STM32 / 8051</span></div><div class="project-thumbs"><a href="assets/bldc-sensor-board.webp" data-lightbox="Motor sensor board"><img src="assets/bldc-sensor-board.webp" alt="Motor sensor board" loading="lazy"></a><a href="assets/bldc-driver-pcb.webp" data-lightbox="Motor driver PCB"><img src="assets/bldc-driver-pcb.webp" alt="Motor driver PCB" loading="lazy"></a></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project-card" data-category="robotics">
            <a class="project-image" href="assets/robot-with-damith.webp" data-lightbox="Humanoid robot project"><img src="assets/robot-with-damith.webp" alt="Damith beside a humanoid service robot prototype" loading="lazy"><span class="image-index">02 / ROBOTICS</span></a>
            <div class="project-body"><div class="project-kicker">SPERA LABS · 2020–2022</div><h3>AI-powered humanoid service robot</h3><p>Hardware and software prototyping for a health-sector service robot, including multi-motor power electronics, sensor integration and battery monitoring.</p><div class="project-thumbs"><a href="assets/robot-full.webp" data-lightbox="Humanoid robot"><img src="assets/robot-full.webp" alt="Humanoid robot" loading="lazy"></a><a href="assets/robot-shell-prototype.webp" data-lightbox="Robot shell prototype"><img src="assets/robot-shell-prototype.webp" alt="Robot body shell prototype" loading="lazy"></a></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project-card" data-category="automation">
            <a class="project-image" href="assets/maldives-control-panel.webp" data-lightbox="Maldives pump control panel"><img src="assets/maldives-control-panel.webp" alt="Electrical control panel for water and sewerage automation" loading="lazy"><span class="image-index">03 / MALDIVES</span></a>
            <div class="project-body"><div class="project-kicker">WATER &amp; SEWERAGE · 2017–2022</div><h3>Pump station &amp; treatment plant automation</h3><p>Electrical design, PLC-based control, pump protection, four-stage water-level control and monitoring systems for facilities across six Maldivian islands.</p><div class="project-thumbs"><a href="assets/maldives-panel-installation.webp" data-lightbox="Panel installation"><img src="assets/maldives-panel-installation.webp" alt="Control panel installation" loading="lazy"></a><a href="assets/pump-monitoring-board.webp" data-lightbox="Pump monitoring board"><img src="assets/pump-monitoring-board.webp" alt="Pump monitoring electronics" loading="lazy"></a></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project-card" data-category="iot">
            <a class="project-image" href="assets/vertical-farm-racks.webp" data-lightbox="Automated vertical farm"><img src="assets/vertical-farm-racks.webp" alt="Indoor vertical farm growing racks" loading="lazy"><span class="image-index">04 / CONNECTED SYSTEMS</span></a>
            <div class="project-body"><div class="project-kicker">HONEST GREEN · 2018–2019</div><h3>Indoor climate-controlled vertical farm</h3><p>Hardware and software for a connected farm automation system, integrating pump, valve and lighting controllers with a central server.</p><div class="project-thumbs"><a href="assets/vertical-farm-led.webp" data-lightbox="Vertical farm lighting"><img src="assets/vertical-farm-led.webp" alt="Vertical farm LED lighting" loading="lazy"></a><a href="assets/vertical-farm-interior.webp" data-lightbox="Vertical farm interior"><img src="assets/vertical-farm-interior.webp" alt="Vertical farm interior" loading="lazy"></a></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project-card" data-category="iot">
            <a class="project-image" href="assets/wifi-power-monitor.webp" data-lightbox="Wi-Fi power monitoring device"><img src="assets/wifi-power-monitor.webp" alt="Wi-Fi power monitoring electronics prototype" loading="lazy"><span class="image-index">05 / IoT PRODUCTS</span></a>
            <div class="project-body"><div class="project-kicker">CONNECTED DEVICES</div><h3>Industrial monitoring &amp; custom electronics</h3><p>Prototype devices for power monitoring, remote pump status, temperature control, wireless connectivity and sensor-data collection.</p><div class="project-thumbs"><a href="assets/wireless-device.webp" data-lightbox="Wireless monitoring device"><img src="assets/wireless-device.webp" alt="Wireless monitoring device" loading="lazy"></a><a href="assets/temperature-control.webp" data-lightbox="Temperature control unit"><img src="assets/temperature-control.webp" alt="Temperature control electronics" loading="lazy"></a></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project-card" data-category="motor">
            <a class="project-image" href="assets/high-rpm-drive.webp" data-lightbox="High RPM motor drive"><img src="assets/high-rpm-drive.webp" alt="High RPM motor drive installation" loading="lazy"><span class="image-index">06 / POWER ELECTRONICS</span></a>
            <div class="project-body"><div class="project-kicker">TIMETIQ / CLIENT R&amp;D</div><h3>Motor drives, BMS &amp; power systems</h3><p>Product R&amp;D covering energy-saving motor drives, battery management, high-power AC motor control, e-bike drives and infrared heating drivers.</p><div class="project-thumbs"><a href="assets/industrial-panel-01.webp" data-lightbox="Industrial control panel"><img src="assets/industrial-panel-01.webp" alt="Industrial electrical panel" loading="lazy"></a><a href="assets/industrial-panel-05.webp" data-lightbox="Industrial installation"><img src="assets/industrial-panel-05.webp" alt="Industrial electrical installation" loading="lazy"></a></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project-card" data-category="iot">
            <a class="project-image" href="assets/scoreboard-project.webp" data-lightbox="IR display project"><img src="assets/scoreboard-project.webp" alt="Large red LED display hardware" loading="lazy"><span class="image-index">07 / PRODUCT DELIVERY</span></a>
            <div class="project-body"><div class="project-kicker">CUSTOM EMBEDDED PRODUCTS</div><h3>Displays, weighing &amp; industrial devices</h3><p>Wireless scoreboard control, scale-to-printer interfaces, remote displays, barcode recognition and industrial data-collection products.</p><div class="project-thumbs"><a href="assets/weighbridge-display.webp" data-lightbox="Weighing system display"><img src="assets/weighbridge-display.webp" alt="Weighing system electronics" loading="lazy"></a><a href="assets/ir-display.webp" data-lightbox="Industrial LED display"><img src="assets/ir-display.webp" alt="Industrial LED display" loading="lazy"></a></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="project-card" data-category="motor">
            <a class="project-image" href="assets/pcb-layout-01.webp" data-lightbox="PCB design layout"><img src="assets/pcb-layout-01.webp" alt="Custom PCB layout design" loading="lazy"><span class="image-index">08 / PCB DESIGN</span></a>
            <div class="project-body"><div class="project-kicker">ELECTRONICS DEVELOPMENT</div><h3>PCB design &amp; prototyping</h3><p>Electronic circuit design, board layout, prototype assembly and testing for embedded and industrial products.</p><div class="project-thumbs"><a href="assets/pcb-layout-02.webp" data-lightbox="PCB layout 2"><img src="assets/pcb-layout-02.webp" alt="PCB layout" loading="lazy"></a><a href="assets/pcb-board-3d.webp" data-lightbox="3D PCB view"><img src="assets/pcb-board-3d.webp" alt="PCB 3D view" loading="lazy"></a></div></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-wrap section-block" id="experience">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">04 / CAREER</div><h2>A career shaped by <em>delivery.</em></h2></div><p>Professional roles and project experience across IT, product R&amp;D and technology leadership.</p></div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <article class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">2001 — 2006</div><div class="timeline-content"><span class="timeline-dot"></span><h3>IT Systems &amp; Administration</h3><strong>AltSoft · Vajira House · Eceylinco</strong><p>Systems administration, software development and IT department leadership.</p></div></article>
        <article class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">2007 — 2018</div><div class="timeline-content"><span class="timeline-dot"></span><h3>Non-Resident Product Developer</h3><strong>TimetiQ Technologies GmbH · Germany</strong><p>Product development in motor drives, battery management, process coordination systems, high-power motor control and measurement electronics.</p></div></article>
        <article class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">2018 — 2023</div><div class="timeline-content"><span class="timeline-dot"></span><h3>Head of Electronics &amp; Innovation</h3><strong>Spera Labs (Pvt) Ltd · Sri Lanka</strong><p>Hardware and software prototyping for humanoid robotics, smart home automation, vehicle tracking and connected farming systems.</p></div></article>
        <article class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">2023 — PRESENT</div><div class="timeline-content"><span class="timeline-dot"></span><h3>Co-Founder &amp; CTO</h3><strong>Perpion (Pvt) Ltd · Sri Lanka</strong><p>Technology development and engineering leadership focused on energy-efficient motor control and connected products.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="patents-section section-block patents-featured" id="patents">
      <div class="section-wrap">
        <div class="patent-intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">05 / INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY</div><h2>Ideas protected. <em>Engineering recognised.</em></h2><p class="patent-lead">A selection of patent records associated with my work in process coordination, information systems, motor control and battery technology.</p></div><div class="patent-highlight"><strong>4</strong><span>US patent records<br>2 granted · 2 applications</span></div></div>
        <div class="patent-family"><div class="family-heading"><span class="family-kicker">FEATURED EUROPEAN PUBLICATION</span><span class="family-line"></span></div><div class="family-main"><div class="family-copy"><div class="patent-status published">EUROPEAN PUBLICATION · EP 2 850 530 A2</div><h3>A System for Formulating Temporal Basis for Operation of Processes for Process Coordination</h3><p>European patent publication for process-coordination technology. The inventor location is identified as Homagama, Sri Lanka, in the publication information supplied for this portfolio.</p><div class="patent-meta"><span>European Patent Office</span><span>EP2850530A2</span><span>Homagama, Sri Lanka</span></div><a class="patent-document-link" href="https://data.epo.org/publication-server/rest/v1.2/patents/EP2850530NWA2/document.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View European patent publication <b>↗</b></a></div><div class="family-badge"><span class="badge-orbit">EP</span><strong>European patent<br>publication</strong><small>Process coordination</small></div></div><div class="family-related"><div><span class="related-label">RELATED US PUBLICATION</span><strong>US 2015/0149676 A1</strong><p>Related US publication for the process-coordination invention; shown as a related publication rather than a separate invention.</p></div><a href="https://patents.justia.com/inventor/don-damith-nadishan-colambathanthrige" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View inventor listing ↗</a></div></div>
        <div class="patent-grid patent-grid-updated">
          <article class="patent-card patent-granted"><div class="patent-card-top"><span class="patent-status granted">GRANTED · US PATENT</span><span class="patent-number">01</span></div><h3>Process Coordination Systems for Genetics-Related Environments</h3><strong class="patent-id">US 9,501,317 B2</strong><p>Granted US patent record. The supplied portfolio lists a grant date of November 22, 2016.</p><span class="patent-kind">Process coordination</span></article>
          <article class="patent-card patent-granted"><div class="patent-card-top"><span class="patent-status granted">GRANTED · US PATENT</span><span class="patent-number">02</span></div><h3>Dynamic Information Transfer Interruption Systems</h3><strong class="patent-id">US 9,875,136 B2</strong><p>Granted US patent record. The supplied portfolio lists a grant date of January 23, 2018.</p><span class="patent-kind">Information systems</span></article>
          <article class="patent-card patent-application"><div class="patent-card-top"><span class="patent-status pending">US APPLICATION</span><span class="patent-number">03</span></div><h3>Energy-Efficient Motor Control Systems</h3><strong class="patent-id">US application 14/400,225</strong><p>Title and number reproduced from the supplied portfolio. Current prosecution status should be checked in the USPTO register.</p><span class="patent-kind">Motor control</span></article>
